    "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/de82f71c8fdc113461748db9107f7d0a.avif?t=1734585783\" data-has-big /></div><br>The Omega Labyrinth Life Deluxe Edition is packed with a variety of DLC, including costumes to dress up characters on the home screen, items to change the Academy's BGM to character songs from the series, and more.<br><br>Deluxe Edition Set Includes<br>1.  &quot;Omega Labyrinth Life&quot; Full Game<br>2.  Pacifier Sword<br>3.  Drool Shield<br>4.  Queen's Whip<br>5.  Bondage Shield<br>6.  Costume: Hinata (Swimsuit)<br>7.  Costume: Berune (Swimsuit)<br>8.  Costume: Mei (Swimsuit)<br>9.  Costume: Mio (Swimsuit)<br>10. Costume: Nanami (Swimsuit)<br>11. Costume: Juri (Swimsuit)<br>12. Costume: Yurika (Swimsuit)<br>13. Costume: Hinata (Animal)<br>14. Costume: Berune (Animal)<br>15. Costume: Mei (Animal)<br>16. Costume: Mio (Animal)<br>17. Costume: Nanami (Animal)<br>18. Costume: Juri (Animal)<br>19. Costume: Yurika (Animal)<br>20. Character Song: Hinata<br>21. Character Song: Berune<br>22. Character Song: Mei<br>23. Character Song: Mio<br>24. Character Song: Nanami<br>25. Character Song: Juri<br>26. Character Song: Yurika<br>27. Character Song: Nem<br>28. Character Song: Pai<br>29. Character Songs &quot;Anberyl&quot; Set of 15</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Roguelike x Relaxation!<br>Take it easy in the latest addition to the series where you buff your bust with every foe you defeat, Omega Labyrinth!<br><br>Now, in addition to adventuring through dungeons, you can enjoy the finer things in life. Taking care of flowers, rebuilding the academy, having a little fun on the side...<br><br>Enjoy your daily life in an academy of fair maidens!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.poster.avif?t=1734585783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.webm?t=1734585783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.mp4?t=1734585783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u25cfA bonafide roguelike RPG you can play again and again!<br><br>Venture through a dungeon with different rooms and items every time you challenge it. Power up your gear and make wise use of your skills to defeat your foes. There are even dungeons with 99 floors!<br><br>\u25cfExpand your bust with every fallen foe! Mightier mammaries lead to greater power!<br><br>Defeating foes builds up Omega Power in the chest, increasing bust size and parameters. They go all the way up to a Z cup!<br><br>\u25cfRaise flowers, rebuild the academy, and more! Enjoy a laid-back life!<br><br>Through planting seeds in the garden and raising flowers, or changing up the decor like the trees, lights or benches, you can change the scenery of the academy like never before in this new addition to the series!<br><br>*This game is adapted from the Nintendo Switch version of Omega Labyrinth Life. Animations, artwork, and game mechanics are the same as Omega Labyrinth Life on the Nintendo Switch.",
    "about_the_game": "Roguelike x Relaxation!<br>Take it easy in the latest addition to the series where you buff your bust with every foe you defeat, Omega Labyrinth!<br><br>Now, in addition to adventuring through dungeons, you can enjoy the finer things in life. Taking care of flowers, rebuilding the academy, having a little fun on the side...<br><br>Enjoy your daily life in an academy of fair maidens!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.poster.avif?t=1734585783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.webm?t=1734585783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163600/extras/d37cec64e90bbec983f915ea15486ee4.mp4?t=1734585783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u25cfA bonafide roguelike RPG you can play again and again!<br><br>Venture through a dungeon with different rooms and items every time you challenge it. Power up your gear and make wise use of your skills to defeat your foes. There are even dungeons with 99 floors!<br><br>\u25cfExpand your bust with every fallen foe! Mightier mammaries lead to greater power!<br><br>Defeating foes builds up Omega Power in the chest, increasing bust size and parameters. They go all the way up to a Z cup!<br><br>\u25cfRaise flowers, rebuild the academy, and more! Enjoy a laid-back life!<br><br>Through planting seeds in the garden and raising flowers, or changing up the decor like the trees, lights or benches, you can change the scenery of the academy like never before in this new addition to the series!<br><br>*This game is adapted from the Nintendo Switch version of Omega Labyrinth Life. Animations, artwork, and game mechanics are the same as Omega Labyrinth Life on the Nintendo Switch.",
